body:
That's so cool @JanPetr. Should we bundle every single analytics service in its own widget to avoid writing again and again the same code?

Like:

```
search.addWidget(instantsearch.widgets.analytics.googleAnalytics());
search.addWidget(instantsearch.widgets.analytics.segment());
search.addWidget(instantsearch.widgets.analytics.kissmetrics());
search.addWidget(instantsearch.widgets.analytics({
    pushFunction: function(formattedParameters, state, results) {
      // any other analytics service
    }
  });
```
